            tagline: "Dudák (Czech for 'Bagpiper') is a popular Czech shedding game closely related to the Russian game Durak.",
          },
          shortDescription: "Dudák (Czech for 'Bagpiper') is a popular Czech shedding game closely related to the Russian game Durak. Played with a 32ndcard Germanndsuited deck, the game is a contest of attrition where players must defend against 'attacks' by beating cards with higher ranks or trumps. The goal is to empty one's hand; the last player left holding cards is the loser—the Dudák.",
